category: Libs
requires: libvvdec3 pkg-config
sdesc: "Fraunhofer Versatile Video Decoder (development)"
ldesc: "The Fraunhofer Versatile Video Decoder (VVdeC) is a fast VVC x86 software
decoder implementation. The decoder supports most standard features available
in the Main10 profile, with support for some high-level features still
pending."
external-source: vvdec

